    "updated_at": "2025-10-01T14:56:52Z",
    "body": "> I wonder if we want to change the spec to make web API-initiated scrolls also stop the navigation scroll. If the user clicks a button that calls `scrollIntoView()` before scroll restoration happens, that would be considered a programmatic scroll.\n\nYea a lot of this can be improved in terms of interop.\nhttps://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#perform-a-scroll doesn't really link to HTML terms.\n\ncc @smfr @emilio (editors of CSSOM-view) and @flackr",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
